scord-edition-2021/#tatoun#4071) - Paris 🇫🇷\n- [@SelaVie#5052](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#selavie#5052) - Toronto 🇨🇦\n- [@KNVL.#7556](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#knvl.#7556) - Kenya 🇰🇪\n- [@Kari’m#9263](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#karim#9263) - Detroit 🇺🇸\n- [@ChinoStaySolow#8122](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#chinostaysolow#8122) - Providence 🇺🇸\n- [@KEVLAR REX#5427](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#kevlar-rex#5427) - Atlanta 🇺🇸\n- [@hiimjae#7572](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#hiimjae#7572)\n- [@DjQueRico#9286](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#djquerico#9286) - Knoxville 🇺🇸\n\n\nArtwork by [joemaloof#3534](https://www.instagram.com/jjjjoemaloof/)\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"UN","published_at":"2021-02-13T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"@KEVLAR REX#5427","position":6}},{"id":"jOLVPtVG2K0","position":5,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"The Weeknd - What You Need (Andrew Luce remix)","track":{"id":"Atj_u41U9Yo","path":"/artists/the-weeknd/tracks/what-you-need-andrew-luce-remix/","slug":"what-you-need-andrew-luce-remix","title":"What You Need (Andrew Luce remix)","artist":{"slug":"the-weeknd","title":"The Weeknd"},"artwork":"images/artists/the-weeknd/tracks/what-you-need-andrew-luce-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"kSD-hwFj9to","slug":"500-discord-edition","tags":[10,3,10],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soul-lyfans/sets/soulection-discord-show-500"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #500 (Discord edition)","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-show-500-discord-edition.jpg","content":"\nSoulection Discord organizes for a night of community DJ's to warmup to Soulection Radio Show #500\n\n<!--more-->\n\nJump to:\n\n\n- [@Geena Marie#6661](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#geena-marie) - Maryland, Washington, D.C. 🇺🇸 \n- [@Lonny#7340](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#lonny) -\n- [@DJClyde#2827](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#dj-clyde) -\n- [@Kalo#4734](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#kalo) - Washington D.C. 🇺🇸 \n- [@jasmineluna222#5328](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#jasmine-luna) - Canada 🇨🇦\n- [@Datsunn#9889](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#datsuun) - Windsor, Canada 🇨🇦\n- [@hiimjae#7572](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#jae-doug) -\n- [@SAINT ANGELO#9693](/episodes/500-discord-edition/#saint-angelo) - \n\n\nArtwork by [@bosourd#1456](https://www.instagram.com/bosourd/) [SC](https://soundcloud.com/bosourd)\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":21600,"location":"UN","published_at":"2021-04-10T14:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Lonny","position":1}},{"id":"GXJLGxJnyTQ","position":16,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"The Weeknd - What You Need","track":{"id":"Qp1dD5N91vA","path":"/artists/the-weeknd/tracks/what-you-need/","slug":"what-you-need","title":"What You Need","artist":{"slug":"the-weeknd","title":"The Weeknd"},"artwork":"images/artists/the-weeknd/tracks/what-you-need.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"Mex0X4UzV48","slug":"103","tags":[1,2,15],"links":{"mixcloud":"https://www.mixcloud.com/soulection/show-103-w-freddie-joachim-mellow-orangeorganology/","soundcloud":null},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #103 w/ Freddie Joachim (Mellow Orange/Organology)","artwork":"images/episodes/103.jpg","content":"\n\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10835,"location":"US","published_at":"2012-10-20T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"Ree6Xkr4_eo","position":41,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"The Weeknd - Wanderlust (Pharrell Remix)","track":{"id":"17sy7Bws7No","path":"/artists/the-weeknd/tracks/wanderlust-pharrell-remix/","slug":"wanderlust-pharrell-remix","title":"Wanderlust (Pharrell Remix)","artist":{"slug":"the-weeknd","title":"The Weeknd"},"artwork":"images/artists/the-weeknd/tracks/wanderlust-pharrell-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"zg_8tfPfypk","slug":"144","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-144-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #144 w/ starRo","artwork":"/images/episodes/144.jpg","content":"\nstarRo hails all the way from Tokyo, Japan to play original productions and edits.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere have been so many guests on Soulection Radio over the past years but no one, we repeat, no one has came in the studio so humble, so low key and just murk the airwaves like starRo did. \nIt's crazy to think that this man has been making music for over 15 years and is barely coming to surface to the world with so much heat. \nWe are just glad he is on our team. He played nothing but original production/edits. \nHailing all the way from Tokyo, Japan, starRo is an artist who you will be familiar with starting from this point on. \nJoe Kay of course opened the show for the first hour & 50 minutes on one turntable (one of the turntable's went out before the show started) playing a bunch of heat that he was holding onto since last week. \nHe made sure to make up for his absence last saturday and play some exclusive Carmack, Atu, Kaytra, Esta, Esgar, Jo Def + some other heavy footwork vibes.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10812,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-14T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"CDxii0Mb5_c","position":43,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"The Weeknd - What You Need (Prison Garde Eight Oh Eight Remix)","track":{"id":"Vkr6A00vYL8","path":"/artists/the-weeknd/tracks/what-you-need-prison-garde-eight-oh-eight-remix/","slug":"what-you-need-prison-garde-eight-oh-eight-remix","title":"What You Need [Prison Garde Eight Oh Eight Remix]","artist":{"slug":"the-weeknd","title":"The Weeknd"},"artwork":"images/artists/the-weeknd/tracks/what-you-need-prison-garde-eight-oh-eight-remix.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"AfbBMadJe6c","slug":"162","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-162"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #162","artwork":"/images/episodes/162.jpg","content":"Joe reaches out to the listeners for the People Choice\n\n<!--more-->\n\nComing off Grammy week connections and our 3 Year Anniversary we returned for yet another solid show. Our special guests who were scheduled for this show couldn't make it but Joe Kay brought out a variety of new and classic gems from the Soulection crates. This show was really engaging because Joe reached out to all the listeners and asked the audience what they wanted to hear via social media. It was amazing to see how many people were listening and how many people requested for a certain track. For the last hour and 1/2 you the people we're DJ'ing/selecting music! How amazing right? Try to tune in live next time. The live feelings is always better. We'll catch you next week at the same time. Spread this if you feel it because it really is strictly about the music. Stay tuned for our 3 Year Anniversary Party announcement on Monday (1/27/14).\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10811,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-18T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"aym6_lADNDE","position":21,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"The Weeknd - What You Need [Prison Garde Eight Oh Eight Remix]","track":{"id":"Vkr6A00vYL8","path":"/artists/the-weeknd/tracks/what-you-need-prison-garde-eight-oh-eight-remix/","slug":"what-you-need-prison-garde-eight-oh-eight-remix","title":"What You Need [Prison Garde Eight Oh Eight Remix]","artist":{"slug":"the-weeknd","title":"The Weeknd"},"artwork":"images/artists/the-weeknd/tracks/what-you-need-prison-garde-eight-oh-eight-remix.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"RaGYFZkpPdU","slug":"211","tags":[7,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulectio